  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pan over medium heat and saute the onion, carrot, and celery until they are softened.",
    "Add the garlic and smoked paprika to the pan and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the flaked salt cod to the pan and stir to combine with the mirepoix base.",
    "Pour in the coconut milk and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and let the mixture cook for 10 minutes.",
    "Stir in the fish sauce and lime juice.",
    "Serve the salt cod mixture over the cooked jasmine rice.",
    "Garnish with chopped cilantro and a wedge of lime."
